    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "brackets.rs has one test module named tests. Add the new test function at the end of that module, before its closing brace. Do not write a second mod tests. Add one pair to PAIRS: U+FF08 and U+FF09. Set the array length to 5. Do not add fullwidth square brackets or fullwidth curly brackets. Do not change is_opener, is_closer, or matching_bracket. They already walk PAIRS. Do not nest an if inside an if.  Do not write two if arms that return the same value. Combine them with ||. That is clippy::if_same_then_else. The existing tests is_opener_names_only_the_open_side and angle_brackets_match stay green. Do not rewrite their assertions. The test a_fullwidth_parenthesis_matches uses TextBuffer::from_str of U+FF08, a, U+FF09. matching_bracket at Offset(0) is Some of Offset(2). is_opener of U+FF08 is true. is_closer of U+FF09 is true. is_opener of U+FF09 is false. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip. Keep the change under about 60 lines. Stay inside this one behavior. Run the full test module named in the commands, not only the new test."
  },
